<meta name="dcterms.publisher" content="United Nations Peace Operations" />
<meta name="dcterms.rights" content="United Nations" />
<meta property="pin:description" content="UNIFIL is deeply concerned by recent activities by the IDF immediately adjacent to the Mission’s position 6-52, southeast of Marun ar Ras (Sector West), inside Lebanese territory. The IDF has been repeatedly informed of this ongoing situation through regular channels.This is an extremely dangerous development. It is unacceptable to compromise the safety of UN peacekeepers carrying out their Security Council-mandated tasks.UNIFIL urgently reminds all actors of their obligations to protect UN personnel and property." />
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
<meta name="twitter:description" content="UNIFIL is deeply concerned by recent activities by the IDF immediately adjacent to the Mission’s position 6-52, southeast of Marun ar Ras (Sector West), inside Lebanese territory. The IDF has been repeatedly informed of this ongoing situation through regular channels.This is an extremely dangerous development. It is unacceptable to compromise the safety of UN peacekeepers carrying out their Security Council-mandated tasks.UNIFIL urgently reminds all actors of their obligations to protect UN personnel and property." />
